Subject: [PATCH] Link selected-channel controls, plugin chains and editor
 batches

Link compatible mixer controls and processor bypass across selected routes, including custom LV2 parameter edits. Add independent plugin insertion, matching-occurrence hover deletion, selection retention and configurable batch editor opening through an existing localized preference.

Preserve Shift and quick-group overrides, relative fader groups, unrelated routes and protected processors. Include Linux integration and actual GUI verification, localization and porting notes. No theme files or proprietary DSP binaries are included.
